      "source_example_id": "e-9076",
      "knowledge_point": "Expressing a Line Integral Along a Path as a Double Integral Using Green's Theorem",
      "kp_id": "e-9076"
    },
    "q-126514": {
      "dom_id": "step-q126514",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14224501/assets/c1f8bb7ed82d345f8397ea9b01854f05f3f668acdcebf5d75ebbc5cb8de04fa6.png)\n\nConsider the path $C$ shown above. Which of the following is equivalent to the line integral \n\n$$\n{∮}_{C}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)-{x}^{2}y)\\,dx+(x{y}^{2}-\\frac{1}{y+1})\\,dy\\,?\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "Green's theorem states that\n\n$$\n{∮}_{C}P\\,dx+Q\\,dy={∬}_{D}(\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}-\\frac{∂P}{∂y})\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nIn our case, the region $D$ and its boundary $C$ satisfy the conditions of Green's theorem:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14224501/assets/9eceb8ab173995a8325fb1a8452baaa7f1071e569391e9a49b69c047d76f3b52.png)\n\nSince $P(x,y)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)-{x}^{2}y$ and $Q(x,y)=x{y}^{2}-\\frac{1}{y+1},$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂P}{∂y}=-{x}^{2},\\,\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}={y}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying Green's theorem, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∮}_{C}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)-{x}^{2}y)\\,dx+(x{y}^{2}-\\frac{1}{y+1})\\,dy & ={∬}_{D}(\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}-\\frac{∂P}{∂y})\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}({y}^{2}-(-{x}^{2}))\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, notice that the region $D$ can be represented in polar coordinates as\n\n$$\nΔ=\\{(r,\\theta )\\,:\\,0\\le r\\le 3,\\,0\\le \\theta \\le \\pi \\}.\n$$\n\nThe change of variables formula for plane polar coordinates states that \n\n$$\n{∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\text{ }dA={∬}_{Δ}\\text{ }f(r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )\\,r\\text{ }drd\\theta .\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write our double integral as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A & ={∬}_{Δ}({r}^{2}{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{r}^{2}{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta )\\,r\\,\\text{d}r\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\,{\\int }_{0}^{3}{r}^{3}\\,dr\\,d\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-126514-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\,{\\int }_{0}^{2}(r+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ))\\,dr\\,d\\theta ",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"72\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-msubsup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222B TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.896em; margin-left: -0.388em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\" style=\"margin-left: 0.647em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 1.506em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.222em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-msubsup space=\"2\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c222B TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.896em; margin-left: -0.388em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\" style=\"margin-left: 0.647em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 1.513em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2061\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-